 "purpose": "A series of questions drawn from several topics: the engine of 'Gemengd oefenen' and, later, exams.",
 "details": "The terminal supplies the themes (domains of the curriculum) as data {theme id: (skill ids)}, so the core does not know the curriculum and Taal joined automatically. kies_onderwerpen picks which practised skills enter the series (weighted: skills that are fading come most, each pick halves its weight, at most 2 in a row from one theme and 3 long questions); maak_vragen builds the questions into a Reeksplan with a Hulp object saying which help exists (Hulp.EXAMEN switches everything off); the terminal plays the plan and Uitslag summarises it per theme. Unit conversion (Maten) takes part through an adapter object. Also holds the parent's choice of themes (child chooses, fixed, or one time).",
 "module_docstring": "Een reeks vragen uit verschillende onderwerpen: Gemengd oefenen nu, de examens later (zonder curses).",
